{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40186175\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过神经肌肉骨骼模型揭示PPN和楔形核活动异常可产生不同FOG亚型，为解释脑干与STN之间可能存在的竞争性运动控制机制提供计算模型证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40211348\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究重点是STN-DBS术后物理治疗的专家共识和康复效果，虽涉及FOG但没有提供STN神经活动与FOG关系的机制性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40274625\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究STN-DBS电极接触点位置与轴性运动结局的关系，为理解STN刺激位置导致步态及轴性症状改善或恶化的异质性提供重要证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40288414\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅比较PD患者有无FOG时的移动能力及药物状态差异，没有涉及STN、DBS或神经活动机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40322896\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究MRI功能连接和体积指标对STN-DBS总体运动疗效的预测作用，但没有FOG特异性结局或STN神经活动与FOG的关联分析。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40325060\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究SNr振荡活动在PD与肌张力障碍之间的差异，但没有分析FOG，也没有建立SNr或STN神经活动与FOG的联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40341797\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过FOG患者的fNIRS研究揭示RAS对SMA、M1及功能连接的调节，为解释皮层网络参与FOG及其与STN相关运动环路的相互作用提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40347799\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"利用静息态fMRI识别PD-FOG相关脑网络特征，涉及锥体外系、显著性网络和SMA，为理解FOG的分布式网络机制及非STN因素提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40392578\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要关注FOG数字生物标志物和深度学习检测性能，不涉及STN神经活动或FOG的神经生理机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40408848\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究STN-DBS刺激位置与步态改善或恶化的关系，采用包含FOG项目的MDS-UPDRS评估，为STN刺激空间定位与FOG结局之间的关系提供直接证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40408878\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然研究STN术中神经放电与多巴胺反应性及认知变化的关系，但没有分析FOG或步态结局，无法回答STN活动与FOG的关联问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40426705\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要讨论DBS对姿势平衡及姿势控制的影响，虽然涉及STN-DBS和步态启动，但缺乏FOG特异性的机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40501019\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究重点是不同频率STN刺激对言语流畅性和运动功能的影响，没有FOG特异性评估或能够解释STN活动与FOG关系的结果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40512756\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD患者药物ON状态下FOG与胆碱能活动的关系，揭示丘脑、纹状体及脑干运动区域的替代性病理机制，有助于解释STN之外的FOG相关神经环路及机制冲突。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40532683\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究STN-DBS调节的结构连接及其与总体UPDRS运动疗效的关系，但没有FOG特异性分析，无法确定相关连接是否解释FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40541541\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究FOG患者步态改善与皮层抑制、感觉运动整合变化的关系，为解释非STN皮层机制及其与基底节运动环路的潜在交互提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40574753\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要讨论PD整体功能网络重塑及神经代偿，没有聚焦FOG或STN相关神经活动，不能直接支持研究问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40595684\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要讨论PD患者DBS精准治疗、靶点选择及设备和编程进展，没有提供FOG特异性的神经生理机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40635563\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究重点是PD疾病修饰试验中药物治疗对生物学指标解释的影响，与STN神经活动及FOG机制没有实质联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40640214\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD-FOG患者接受不同频率STN刺激时的冲突解决能力及额叶激活变化，为解释STN刺激、额叶认知控制网络与FOG之间的机制联系提供关键证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40652355\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者不同提示策略对步态及皮层活动的影响，但没有FOG特异性分组或STN相关测量，不能直接回答研究问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40678756\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过静息态fMRI比较有无FOG患者的脑区活动，揭示皮层、小脑和基底节的差异，为评估FOG的分布式网络机制及其与STN活动的关系提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40728819\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"利用EEG研究FOG患者任务状态下额叶和顶叶神经动态熵异常，为理解FOG相关皮层认知运动处理机制及其与STN环路的潜在交互提供补充证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40738500\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究GPi-DBS相关结构连接对FOG及术后改善的预测作用，为比较STN与其他基底节靶点的FOG调控机制及网络差异提供重要对照证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:40738895\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"该社论主题为PD侵入性与非侵入性神经调控的总体进展，缺乏摘要及FOG或STN神经活动的具体证据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "14b1ee02-3fac-4eb5-84be-af8c321d8c6c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T135057617112Z", "elapsed_seconds": 120.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T13:52:57.771391+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9ac4f0dfb7f781c410b5d1f8a60c5646431f3b1eb9fc93771607a4e261b5da28", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T135057617112Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "996b47cb39bccbf3317e605edc75b3a333bf449867692f80cc40c8c2d56b51cf"}}}
